window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Bigfoot, long plagued by sexually crazed campers wanting some of his sweet musky loving makes a pact with a nefarious transmale scientist who exchanges a chastity belt to prevent his fondling by campers for his semen to load his prosthesis which is unicorn horned in shape and bright purple, and yes, sparkles. To acquire his sperm the mad scientist milks his prostate with the appendage. Happiness finds him when a camper finds him and begins to love him for him, not his awesome bigfoot sperm. To fully consummate their new partnership, they need to get the key from the mad scientist. Hilarity and comedic romance ensues.</p>"; 
